  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maldives Resilient Communities Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this initiative promotes renewable energy adoption and strengthen coral reef conservation in marine protected areas. The program will achieve this through innovative solutions, capacity building, and infrastructure enhancement. This approach will advance local-level adaptation and mitigation actions that empower communities, foster sustainable economic opportunities, and contribute to Maldives&#x2019; NDCs, with a focus on gender equality, effective local governance, and circular economy principles.</narrative>
  </description>
